{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_LOGO.png?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sex &amp; Coffee</strong> \u2615\ufe0f\ud83e\udd0e is an adult visual novel about romance, freshly brewed coffee, magic, and temptation in a modern fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a world where goblins are TikTok influencers, trolls sell ice cream, and fairies drive taxis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Today\u2019s_menu.png?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re new barista at a cozy coffee shop that\u2019s become the go-to spot for people seeking more than just the perfect cup of coffee \u2014 they come here for connection.<strong> But there\u2019s a catch:</strong> the shop is on the brink of shutting down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Coffee_crafting_like_a_pro.png?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/932_Coffeestory_Orc_Cinema_date1_2_apo8-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You\u2019ll meet key characters like:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sonia, the cute bunny cop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beata, the mysterious demon writer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shaya, the badass orc financial analyst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ila, the free-spirited elf</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Characters.png?t=1745427224\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Flirting_and_connections.png?t=1745427224\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/932_Coffeestory_Rabbit_coffee_date1_3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s up to you to save it by mastering the art of coffee and winning over the hearts of the locals. Get to know your enchanting customers \u2014 each with their own baggage and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Spicy_dates.png?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/932_Coffeestory_Elf_Fair_date8_2_2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745427224\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Exclusive_content.png?t=1745427224\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Key_features.png?t=1745427224\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coffee crafting like a pro</strong>: Unlock unique recipes using magical ingredients and create drinks that wow your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flirting and connections</strong>: Build relationships with the girls, deciding whether to go all-in on one or see where things lead with all of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spicy side quests</strong>: Take on special &quot;after-dark&quot; missions to uncover deeper secrets about the world and its characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the city</strong>: Meet quirky fantasy creatures, discover their stories, and spread the word about your coffee shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exclusive content:</strong> Unlock steamy and intimate moments with the characters as your relationships evolve.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/4.2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745427224\" /><strong>Sex &amp; Coffee</strong> \u2615\ufe0f\ud83e\udd0e isn\u2019t just about brewing drinks \u2014 it\u2019s about brewing love, magic, and temptation in every cup. Your choices will shape the future of the coffee shop and the fiery connections you build along the way. So, who\u2019s ready for a refill?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/extras/Full_Available.png?t=1745427224\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426260?t=1745427224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426260?t=1745427224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/09879069453727c4a2a49dfb50e6eb987ad3f8cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745427224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426260/09879069453727c4a2a49dfb50e6eb987ad3f8cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745427224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains content not appropriate for all ages, or for viewing at work: sexual content, nudity. The game graphically depicts sex. All characters in the game are over the age of 18."},"demos":[{"appid":3479130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb